 bool VR_ShouldCaptureAuthoredReticleThisFrame()
 {
+    // C-H4-50: Halo 4's whole-CUI replay is not a proven authored-reticle
+    // boundary. In the 7a24814 Steam log it spent minutes at art=0, then one
